          "source_text": "Suppose that <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> are objects of a category <MATH_0003>\nand that <MATH_0004> are morphisms. We say a morphism\n<MATH_0005> is a <TEXTITOPEN_0001>coequalizer<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> for the pair <MATH_0006> if\n<MATH_0007> and if <MATH_0008> satisfies the following\nuniversal property: For every morphism <MATH_0009>\nin <MATH_0010> such that <MATH_0011> there exists\na unique morphism <MATH_0012> such that <MATH_0013>.\n",
          "source_text_hash": "sha256:5bd0311e434b60b7a24eb444ff9b61fe1c5d62b36149a9b32e5d022eb33268a4",
          "unit_id": "tag:002A:statement"
